{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"達卡青奧　港隊滑浪風帆銀牌得主吳海迪凱旋\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SPO-OLY-BACK-261114-18.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】在達卡青年奧運為港隊奪得男子滑浪風帆銀牌的吳海迪凱旋。</p><p>15歲的吳海迪獲得港隊一眾隊友到場迎接。教練徐梓熙2010年協助鄭俊樑贏得首屆新加坡青奧銀牌，相隔16年再為港隊培育出第二位青奧滑浪風帆獎牌得主。</p><p>港隊今屆累積2金2銀3銅，金牌及獎牌數目都是歷屆之最。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:03:57.482290+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:25:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:39:47.682343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:25.721035+00:00","content_hash":"18ab13002f278d271fa353b3ed53dcdc7ff442d849fb5df14c5d630ae7784798","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:03:57.482290+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}